start-19\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#github-web-ui\",\"content\":\"Select **Use this template**, then **Create a new repository**.\"}],[\"/quickstart-20\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-20\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#github-web-ui\",\"content\":\"Choose an owner and name, select **Private**, then create the repository.\"}],[\"/quickstart-21\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-21\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#github-web-ui\",\"content\":\"The generated repository automatically runs **Initialize AgentBoard demo**. Wait for that workflow to pass. It creates the lifecycle labels and twelve issues, then renders the repository-specific `.agentboard.toml`.\"}],[\"/quickstart-22\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-22\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#github-web-ui\",\"content\":\"Clone the initialized repository:\"}],[\"/quickstart-23\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-23\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#github-web-ui\",\"content\":\"If you cloned before initialization completed, run `git pull --ff-only` after the workflow passes.\"}],[\"/quickstart-24\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-24\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#github-web-ui\",\"content\":\"The generated Workspace contains three configured GitHub Sources:\"}],[\"/quickstart-25\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-25\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#github-web-ui\",\"content\":\"**implement** — open issues labelled `agentboard:ready-for-agent`;\"}],[\"/quickstart-26\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-26\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#github-web-ui\",\"content\":\"**review** — open issues labelled `agentboard:ready-for-review`;\"}],[\"/quickstart-27\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-27\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#github-web-ui\",\"content\":\"**cleanup** — closed issues labelled both `agentboard:review-complete` and `agentboard:cleanup-approved`.\"}],[\"/quickstart-28\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-28\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"Start or attach to the demo Zellij session:\"}],[\"/quickstart-29\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-29\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"The `queue` tab automatically runs:\"}],[\"/quickstart-30\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-30\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"Open the temporary repository from another terminal:\"}],[\"/quickstart-31\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-31\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"Choose two issues and apply `agentboard:ready-for-agent`.\"}],[\"/quickstart-32\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-32\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#2-start-watch-and-release-two-issues\",\"content\":\"GitHub Search can take several seconds to index a label change. On the next matching run, AgentBoard creates or reuses the issue worktree and opens its Zellij tab. Each tab keeps Neovim visible while Pi runs in a separate pane.\"}],[\"/quickstart-33\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-33\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"The implementation Pi session reads the issue, runs its task-specific shell test, commits, pushes, and creates or updates a PR containing `Closes #<issue>`. It then moves the issue to `agentboard:ready-for-review`.\"}],[\"/quickstart-34\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-34\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"The review Source starts a separate reviewer Pi session in the same issue tab:\"}],[\"/quickstart-35\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-35\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"**Pass:** Pi comments with review evidence and applies `agentboard:review-complete`. Review and merge the PR yourself in GitHub.\"}],[\"/quickstart-36\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-36\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"**Changes requested:** Pi comments, applies `agentboard:changes-requested`, and returns the issue to `agentboard:ready-for-agent`. The implementation Source resumes the deterministic implementation session in the existing worktree.\"}],[\"/quickstart-37\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-37\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#3-observe-implementation-and-review\",\"content\":\"After merging both accepted PRs, apply `agentboard:cleanup-approved` to their closed issues. The cleanup Source removes each worktree and closes its issue tab.\"}],[\"/quickstart-38\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-38\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#4-tear-down-the-throwaway-demo\",\"content\":\"From the generated repository root, run:\"}],[\"/quickstart-39\",{\"id\":\"/quickstart-39\",\"page_id\":\"/quickstart\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/quickstart#4-tear-down-the-throwaway-demo\",\"content\":\"`teardown.sh` verifies the repository's immutable ID, template origin, private visibility, and repository ownership marker before deleting the Zellij session, worktrees, remote repository, and local clone. If GitHub refuses repository deletion, run `gh auth refresh -h github.com -s delete_repo` and repeat teardown.\"}],[\"/why\",{\"id\":\"/why\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Why AgentBoard\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"AgentBoard\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why\"}],[\"/why-0\",{\"id\":\"/why-0\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/why#why-agentboard\",\"content\":\"Why AgentBoard\"}],[\"/why-1\",{\"id\":\"/why-1\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-agentboard\",\"content\":\"Task trackers are good at tracking. Agents need repeatable local work queues.\"}],[\"/why-2\",{\"id\":\"/why-2\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-agentboard\",\"content\":\"AgentBoard copies task-like items from sources like QMD-backed markdown into a local store, then runs configured actions such as creating worktrees and launching commands.\"}],[\"/why-3\",{\"id\":\"/why-3\",\"page_id\":\"/why\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/why#why-agentboard\",\"content\":\"AgentBoard is deliberately not a tracker replacement. Keep truth upstream. Use AgentBoard as the local automation bridge.\"}],[\"/cli/actions\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"page\",\"content\":\"Actions\",\"breadcrumbs\":[\"AgentBoard\",\"Cli\"],\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions\"}],[\"/cli/actions-0\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-0\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"Actions\"}],[\"/cli/actions-1\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-1\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#workspace-shape\",\"content\":\"Workspace Shape\"}],[\"/cli/actions-2\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-2\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#execution-order\",\"content\":\"Execution Order\"}],[\"/cli/actions-3\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-3\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#retry-identity\",\"content\":\"Retry Identity\"}],[\"/cli/actions-4\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-4\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#action-docs\",\"content\":\"Action Docs\"}],[\"/cli/actions-5\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-5\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"type\":\"heading\",\"tags\":[],\"url\":\"/cli/actions#trust-model\",\"content\":\"Trust Model\"}],[\"/cli/actions-6\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-6\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"Actions are steps that are run after new items have been retrieved from a source.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-7\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-7\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"Define them in the `sources.actions` array in your workspace config.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-8\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-8\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"Each action is a sequential step that runs for each item in the source. Actions are blocking per item.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-9\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-9\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#actions\",\"content\":\"This CLI doc only covers orchestration: ordering, retry identity, and trust model. Action-specific config belongs in each action crate doc.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-10\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-10\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#execution-order\",\"content\":\"Sources run concurrently. Item Actions inside one Source are serial.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-11\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-11\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\"url\":\"/cli/actions#execution-order\",\"content\":\"For each item retrieved by a Source, agentboard will then execute Actions in the order they are defined in the `sources.actions` array.\"}],[\"/cli/actions-12\",{\"id\":\"/cli/actions-12\",\"page_id\":\"/cli/actions\",\"tags\":[],\"type\":\"text\",\